From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: test <test@example.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:14:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: port desktop 29 parity

- Port member-rank prefetch, exact leading reply quotes, story posting gate, bot previews, sharp folder emoji, plain calendar, gift-offer hiding and Money coverage.
- Add bounded incoming Money transfer notices and chat-menu badge, earlier on-chain password guards, and per-socket media-to-regular download fallback after two pre-data timeouts.
- Desktop-only reply-next, Linux helper packaging and AI bot-info editing are not applicable to this fork.
